flowchart TD
    A[App Start\nsrc/main.rs] --> B[Native App Bootstrap\nsrc/native_app/app.rs]
    B --> C[Load Config / Import Dock\nsrc/native_app/refresh.rs]
    C --> D[Adapters\nDock import, running apps,\napp resolver, icon loader]
    D --> E[Domain Models\nsrc/domain]
    E --> F[Merge Dock State\nsrc/services/dock_state.rs]
    F --> G[Native View Models\nsrc/native_app/view_model.rs]
    G --> H[Render Dock Panel\nsrc/native_app/dock_view.rs]

    H --> I[Click Dock Item]
    I --> J[Launcher\nsrc/services/launcher.rs]
    J --> K[Activate or Launch App]

    H --> L[Hover Multi-window App]
    L --> M[Read Windows via AX\nsrc/native_app/window_menu.rs]
    M --> N[Native Popover\nsrc/native_app/window_popup.rs]
    N --> O[Activate Specific Window]

    H --> P[Right Click Dock Item]
    P --> Q[Native Context Menu\nsrc/native_app/app_context_menu.rs]
    Q --> R[Kill / Force Kill / Copy PID]

    B --> S[Install AX Observer\nsrc/native_app/ax_window_manager.rs]
    S --> T[Window Geometry Events]
    T --> U[Window Clamper\nsrc/native_app/window_clamper.rs]
    U --> V[Keep Windows Inside\nCustom Work Area]

    C --> W[Persisted Config Store\nsrc/config]
